<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5442" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Blanda</span></b> , ae. f.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A maritime town in Lucania</i>, now <i>Maratea</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 4, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5,
				10, § 72</span></i> (in <i><span class="en">Liv. 24,
				20, 5</span></i>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Blandae</span></b> ,
			ārum).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A small maritime town in</i> Hispania
			Tarraconensis, now <i>Blanes</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 6,
			5</span></i> (in <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 3, 4, § 22</span></i>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Blandae</span></b> , ārum).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
